REGEDIT4

; A lean 32-bit Wine session for one-shot console programs:
; wineboot --init starts only what a console program needs. The
; Event Log (svchost), NDIS, the NSI proxy and Plug and Play become
; demand-start; MountMgr (drives) stays. This takes
; `wine cmd /c echo` from 8.3-8.5 s to 6.2-6.7 s (5 processes instead
; of 7). Not for games: Plug and Play starts the bus drivers that HID and
; game controllers come through.
;   wine regedit /S lean-session.reg   (or merge into the prefix's system.reg)

[HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\System\CurrentControlSet\Services\Eventlog]
"Start"=dword:00000003

[HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\System\CurrentControlSet\Services\NDIS]
"Start"=dword:00000003

[HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\System\CurrentControlSet\Services\nsiproxy]
"Start"=dword:00000003

[HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\System\CurrentControlSet\Services\PlugPlay]
"Start"=dword:00000003
